+    // The RomFS's own header or file table fails the hash check (Mario Kart 8 Deluxe's base with a 4.0.1 update read on
+    // 2026-11-14): no file can be listed, so instead of an unhandled exception (exit 0xE0434352) this is reported as a damaged
